---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<Layout title="About · Frederico Santos">
  <nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-accent text-sm font-bold tracking-tight">
        frederico<span class="text-text-dim">@</span>fsx.app
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="text-text-muted hover:text-accent text-xs transition-colors">← back</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
    <SectionHeader title="About" />

    <div class="pl-6 border-l border-border space-y-5 mt-8 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <span class="text-border">├──</span> I'm a second-year PhD candidate in <span class="text-text">Applied Data Science &amp; Artificial Intelligence</span> at the
        <a href="https://www.units.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-text transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">University of Trieste</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-border">├──</span> My research uses methods from evolutionary computation to design a
        <span class="text-text">GPU-native PyTorch framework for neuroevolution</span>, evolving neural network topologies through composable blocks at micro- and macro-structural scales.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-border">├──</span> Five peer-reviewed publications, including a Q1 journal article in
        <em>Applied Soft Computing</em> and papers at CORE A conferences (GECCO, EuroGP, EvoApplications).
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-border">├──</span> Before the PhD I trained in
        <span class="text-text">Data Science &amp; Advanced Analytics</span> at NOVA IMS Lisbon
        (GPA 18/20, thesis adapted for publication) and in
        <span class="text-text">Management &amp; Business Administration</span> at Católica Lisbon.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-border">└──</span> Based in Trieste, Italy. <span class="text-text">Portuguese</span> (native), <span class="text-text">English</span> (fluent), <span class="text-text">Italian</span> (A1).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm font-mono">
      <a href="/cv" class="border border-border rounded-lg p-4 bg-surface/40 hover:bg-surface/80 hover:border-accent/30 transition-all">
        <span class="text-accent">cv/</span>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">Full education, experience and awards.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/frederico-santos-cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="border border-border rounded-lg p-4 bg-surface/40 hover:bg-surface/80 hover:border-accent/30 transition-all">
        <span class="text-accent">cv.pdf ↓</span>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">Download the single-page PDF.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/publications" class="border border-border rounded-lg p-4 bg-surface/40 hover:bg-surface/80 hover:border-accent/30 transition-all">
        <span class="text-accent">publications/</span>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">5 peer-reviewed papers, 2023–2026.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3589-7877" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="border border-border rounded-lg p-4 bg-surface/40 hover:bg-surface/80 hover:border-accent/30 transition-all">
        <span class="text-accent">orcid →</span>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">0000-0003-3589-7877</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
